# Quickstart Guide

## R
```r
library(tidyverse)
data <- read_csv("dataset.csv")
summary(data)
ggplot(data, aes(x=var1, y=var2)) + geom_point()
```

## Python
```python
import pandas as pd
import seaborn as sns
df = pd.read_csv("dataset.csv")
print(df.describe())
sns.scatterplot(data=df, x="var1", y="var2")
```
